{"resourceIdentifier":"2753","resourceName":"Sustainable Biogas Project for Community Empowerment","description":"The project activity involves the operation of 15,100 household biogas plants (biodigestors) in Haryana state, India. All Biodigesters are of 3m3 capacity. The biogas plants are of deenbandhu model. The purpose of the project is to replace the commonly used inefficient wood-fired mud stoves technology, with clean, sustainable, and efficient biogas. Each household utilizes cow dung to feed the digester for the production of biogas for cooking purposes and heating water. In addition, the hygienic conditions in the rural areas will be improved by the appropriate disposal of organic waste. Further, residue from the biodigesters can be used as organic fertilizer and will improve soil conditions in rural areas leading to an increase in soil productivity. Project activity will contribute towards sustainable development by replacing nonrenewable firewood with biogas generated from biodigesters. The project activity involves bundling of 15,100 plants installed in rural areas of Haryana","location":{"latitude":29.058800,"longitude":76.085600},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-02-16","endExclusive":"2022-03-19","endInclusive":"2022-03-18"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2753"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Haryana"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Green Solutions"},{"type":"string","value":"Uttarakhand, India"},{"type":"string","value":"+91-9412127663"},{"type":"string","value":"greensolutions.mailbox@gmail.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2753"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"38236"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEG